Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:57:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] F635-1: ActionAbilityDelivered and RefundUntilDelivered
 (data 16.635.3)

A use of an ability whose row sets RefundUntilDelivered waits for an ActionAbilityDelivered row run on a
followed copy; the last copy leaving before it gives the cost back once. Inferred from the tables (b).
Core tests: 16.402.22 2142/0; 16.635.3 (guard bypassed for the run) 47 -> 28 failures.
BattleGiantHeroAbilityTest reads the slap stop as the group's last part (16.635.3 puts the mark first).
